title: With a regular expression the replacement of the Search panel fills in $1: fn step_N( becomes fn stage_N( for every N, in the file and nowhere else
folders: plain
limit: 50
forbid-log: WARN.*script
forbid-log: script: ignoring
expect-log: replaced 14 matches in 1 files \(0 could not be read\)
expect-file: plain/src/steps.rs :: (?s)\Afn stage_1\(\) -> u32 \{\n    1\n\}.*fn stage_14\(\) -> u32 \{\n    14\n\}
expect-file: plain/src/main.rs :: steps::step_1\(\)

wait 3000
search-option regex on
search fn step_(\d+)\(
wait 1500
search-option replace fn stage_$1(
wait 400
mark preview
wait 450
search-option replace-all
wait 800
answer Replace
wait 2500
mark replaced
wait 450
quit
